<title>USA: Pfizer licenses Corvas therapy.</title>
<headline>Pfizer licenses Corvas therapy.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corvas International Inc on Monday said Pfizer Inc would enter an exclusive agreement to develop and commercialize Corvas' neutrophil inhibitory factor (NIF) as a potential stroke therapy.</p>
<p>It said that if products were successfully commercialized, Corvas could receive up to $29 million in further development funding and milestone payments from Pfizer, in addition to royalty payments.</p>
</text>
